{"availability":"available","full":"chioarub/openclaude-studio","name":"openclaude-studio","description":"Read-only companion dashboard for OpenClaude local projects, sessions, tasks, usage, and logs.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":1,"created":"2026-05-28T17:11:34Z","updated":"2026-09-17T18:15:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://openclaude-studio.pages.dev/","topics":["dashboard","developer-tools","diagnostics","fastify","local-first","logs","openclaude","privacy","react","read-only","tailwind","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://openclaude-studio.pages.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.336Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.336Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.336Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.336Z","stars":8,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["OpenClaude Studio is a read-only companion dashboard for OpenClaude. Run a small local API on your machine, open the hosted web app, and inspect projects, sessions, plans, tasks, providers, diagnostics, usage, and debug logs without editing local OpenClaude data.","The project is intentionally scoped around a small read-only foundation: a hosted or local web app talks to a local server running on your machine. The server reads OpenClaude files from disk, redacts likely secrets, and exposes only read-only HTTP endpoints.","OpenClaude Studio is an independent community companion dashboard for OpenClaude. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anthropic."],"features":["Inspect sessions, assistant messages, tool calls, tool results, errors, changed files, usage, and cost.","Review linked plans, linked tasks, and checklist progress without opening raw task files.","Search project-scoped debug logs without opening raw log files.","Review provider profiles, startup launch profile diagnostics, provider recognition, and safe temp